{
  "_comment": "Role/label locators for the brand QA harnesses (scripts/qa/lib/ui.mjs makeLocate). Update labels here when the brand pass renames a control; a name may be a string (exact) or {\"regex\": \"...\"}. `label` uses getByLabel, `text` uses getByText, `css` uses page.locator (only for controls whose accessible name is not stable, e.g. the save chip). Names verified in the DOM of the integrated candidate 7083387. Editor chrome names follow W6 (claude/flows-v2 a384435): the ⋯ menu is the button/menu \"This build\"; Settings/Help are menu items there; camera cluster is group \"Camera view\"; My worlds / My class live in the Account menu.",
